  "title": "Keto Lemon-Garlic Chicken Thighs in the Air Fryer",
  "description": "These keto-friendly and low-carb chicken thighs are packed with tangy lemon and garlic flavor. Serve with mashed cauliflower or your favorite keto side dish.",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
  ],
